WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:04.210
HOW MUCH MORE DIFFICULT DOES IT

00:00:01.707 --> 00:00:07.146
MAKE IT FOR YOU?

00:00:04.343 --> 00:00:08.814
&gt;&gt;  WE’LL JOIN IF NECESSARY.

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:10.649
THAT WAS GOVERNOR OF FLORIDA

00:00:08.948 --> 00:00:12.952
RICK SCOTT ON THE SCENE.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:13.986
WE’RE JOINED NOW TO TALK ABOUT

00:00:13.085 --> 00:00:16.555
THIS HORRIFIC DAY.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.623
WHAT CAN WE LEARN FROM WHAT WE

00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:20.293
KNOW SO FAR?

00:00:17.757 --> 00:00:21.494
AND CAN THESE SCHOOLS REALLY BE

00:00:20.426 --> 00:00:26.799
SAFER IN THE FACE OF THESE

00:00:21.627 --> 00:00:29.035
THREATS OF MASS SHOOTINGS?

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.336
GENTLEMEN, IT’S GOOD TO SEE YOU

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:31.704
ON ANOTHER AWFUL NIGHT.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.306
MARK, LET’S START WITH YOU.

00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:33.606
YOU’VE BEEN TAKING THIS ALL IN

00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:35.241
TODAY.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:38.911
WHAT ARE YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:41.414
&gt;&gt;  WELL, LAURA, WHEN YOU LOOK

00:00:39.045 --> 00:00:46.252
AT THIS SINCE COLUMBINE, IT

00:00:41.547 --> 00:00:48.054
SEEMS THAT PUBLIC SCHOOLS HAVE

00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:48.755
GRAPPLED WITH SECURITY IN A LOT

00:00:48.188 --> 00:00:52.792
OF WAYS.

00:00:48.888 --> 00:00:54.594
THEY’VE COME UP WITH A LOT OF

00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:55.829
SCENARIOS, BUT WE HAVE TO LOOK

00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:56.262
AT THE THINGS THAT ARE COMING

00:00:55.962 --> 00:00:58.331
UP.

00:00:56.396 --> 00:00:58.999
AND ONCE AGAIN, GUN CONTROL

00:00:58.465 --> 00:01:01.101
COMES UP.

00:00:59.132 --> 00:01:05.172
ONCE AGAIN, MENTAL ILLNESS.

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:05.505
WE’RE NOT GOING TO STOP MENTAL

00:01:05.305 --> 00:01:06.873
ILLNESS.

00:01:05.639 --> 00:01:09.142
WE’RE NOT GOING TO GET RID OF

00:01:07.007 --> 00:01:10.911
THE SECOND AMENDMENT.

00:01:09.276 --> 00:01:12.679
WE CAN HARDEN THE TARGET.

00:01:11.044 --> 00:01:15.048
WE CAN LOCK DOWN SCHOOLS.

00:01:12.813 --> 00:01:17.117
WE CAN HAVE METAL DETECTORS.

00:01:15.182 --> 00:01:19.019
WE CAN MAKE THE KIDS SAFE SO THE

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:21.355
SHOOTER JUST CAN’T WALK INTO THE

00:01:19.152 --> 00:01:22.256
SCHOOL ANYTIME HE PLEASES.

00:01:21.488 --> 00:01:24.691
AND THAT’S WHAT HAPPENS EVERY

00:01:22.389 --> 00:01:25.058
SINGLE TIME IN ONE OF THESE

00:01:24.825 --> 00:01:27.394
SHOOTINGS.

00:01:25.192 --> 00:01:28.762
&gt;&gt;  I WAS AT MY KID’S SCHOOL

00:01:27.528 --> 00:01:30.531
TODAY AND IT WAS SO WEIRD

00:01:28.896 --> 00:01:33.033
BECAUSE I WAS BUZZED IN.

00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:38.372
EVERY TIME I’M BUZZED IN TO A

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:39.673
SCHOOL TO VISIT MY KIDS, I

00:01:38.505 --> 00:01:43.110
ALWAYS THINK ABOUT THESE THINGS.

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:43.444
IT’S EASY TO GET INTO MOST

00:01:43.244 --> 00:01:45.412
SCHOOLS.

00:01:43.577 --> 00:01:46.614
YOU CAN KILL A SECURITY GUARD,

00:01:45.546 --> 00:01:48.315
THEY FORCE SOMEONE TO BUZZ YOU

00:01:46.747 --> 00:01:49.683
IN, THEN THEY’RE IN.

00:01:48.449 --> 00:01:51.719
WHAT CAN YOU DO?

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:52.119
YOU CAN’T TURN A SCHOOL INTO A

00:01:51.852 --> 00:01:53.854
PRISON.

00:01:52.253 --> 00:01:54.989
AND SO THEN PEOPLE GET LOCKED

00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:57.291
INTO CLASSROOMS.

00:01:55.122 --> 00:01:58.693
AND IS THAT A GOOD IDEA GIVEN

00:01:57.425 --> 00:01:59.961
THE FACT THAT THEN YOU’RE A

00:01:58.826 --> 00:02:01.262
TARGET IN A CLASSROOM?

00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:02.296
I’M NOT AN EXPERT IN THIS.

00:02:01.395 --> 00:02:05.133
YOU ARE, RANDY.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.968
&gt;&gt;  YOU SAID IT VERY WELL, THAT

00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:08.936
WE CAN’T MAKE THESE SCHOOLS INTO

00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:10.571
A PRISON.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:12.473
HOWEVER, WE CAN TARGET HARDEN.

00:02:10.705 --> 00:02:15.176
THERE’S A VERY WISE MAN THAT

00:02:12.607 --> 00:02:16.377
ONCE SAID, "IF IT’S PREDICTABLE,

00:02:15.309 --> 00:02:19.414
IT’S PREVENTABLE."

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:20.915
AND UNFORTUNATELY, WE HAVE NOW

00:02:19.547 --> 00:02:21.316
FOUND THAT SCHOOL SHOOTINGS ARE

00:02:21.049 --> 00:02:23.718
PREDICTABLE.

00:02:21.449 --> 00:02:29.591
SO WE HAVE TO DISCOVER THE WAYS

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:31.693
THAT WE CAN TARGET HARDEN THESE

00:02:29.724 --> 00:02:33.395
SCHOOLS AND AT LEAST GIVE THESE

00:02:31.826 --> 00:02:34.896
CHILDREN AND TEACHERS AND STAFF

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:36.531
MEMBERS A CHANCE.

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:38.733
THERE’S CLEARLY A CORRELATION

00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:40.735
HERE THAT WE HAVE SEEN TONIGHT

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:42.637
THAT THERE WAS -- BECAUSE OF

00:02:40.869 --> 00:02:43.772
TRAINING, MANY, MANY LIVES THAT

00:02:42.771 --> 00:02:44.739
WERE SAVED.

00:02:43.905 --> 00:02:47.876
SO THAT’S A POSITIVE.

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:49.711
BUT WE HAVE TO LOOK AT A WAY TO

00:02:48.009 --> 00:02:51.113
PREVENT WHAT IS PREDICTABLE.

00:02:49.845 --> 00:02:52.314
&gt;&gt;  MARK, LET’S GO BACK TO YOU

00:02:51.246 --> 00:02:54.650
ON THIS.

00:02:52.447 --> 00:02:56.251
WE FOUND OUT THAT HE WAS DENIED

00:02:54.783 --> 00:02:57.753
ENTRANCE TO THE SCHOOL CAMPUS

00:02:56.385 --> 00:02:59.588
NOT SO LONG AGO WHEN HE WAS

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:03.325
CARRYING A BACKPACK.

00:02:59.721 --> 00:03:07.796
HE HAD REPORTEDLY MADE THREATS,

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:09.064
SOME IN JEST, SOME PERHAPS NOT,

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:13.135
AGAINST STUDENTS.

00:03:09.198 --> 00:03:15.170
HE WAS SOCIALLY OSTRACIZED.

00:03:13.268 --> 00:03:16.438
HIS MOTHER DIED LAST YEAR.

00:03:15.304 --> 00:03:18.507
HE WAS AN ADOPTED YOUNG MAN.

00:03:16.572 --> 00:03:18.874
HE HAS FAMILY IN THE AREA,

00:03:18.641 --> 00:03:20.776
OBVIOUSLY.

00:03:19.008 --> 00:03:30.820
BUT HIS MOTHER DIED.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:33.456
HE FOLLOWED THE IRAQI RESISTANCE

00:03:30.953 --> 00:03:35.291
ONLINE AND FIGHTERS.

00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:37.293
SOCIAL MEDIA OF HIM WITH VARIOUS

00:03:35.424 --> 00:03:40.496
KNIVES, VARIOUS GUNS, ASKING

00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:43.132
ABOUT LONG GUN BACKGROUND

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:44.367
CHECKS, PARTICULAR AMMUNITION.

00:03:43.266 --> 00:03:44.734
HE WAS GETTING READY FOR

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.668
SOMETHING.

00:03:44.867 --> 00:03:49.071
&gt;&gt;  WELL, THESE ARE CLUES.

00:03:45.802 --> 00:03:50.540
AND THERE’S A THOUSAND PEOPLE

00:03:49.205 --> 00:03:52.675
THAT PEOPLE CAN NAME RIGHT NOW

00:03:50.673 --> 00:03:54.777
THAT ARE WATCHING THIS SHOW OF

00:03:52.809 --> 00:03:56.779
YOURS RIGHT NOW THAT SAY HE FITS

00:03:54.911 --> 00:04:00.316
THAT PROFILE.

00:03:56.913 --> 00:04:02.051
SO IF WE CAN PROFILE AND WE CAN

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.519
ACTUALLY TARGET THESE PEOPLE AND

00:04:02.185 --> 00:04:05.221
ACTUALLY NOTIFY SOMEBODY, IS

00:04:03.653 --> 00:04:06.589
THERE REALLY AN AGENCY THAT’S

00:04:05.355 --> 00:04:08.658
GOING TO DO ANYTHING?

00:04:06.723 --> 00:04:11.194
ON SEAN HANNITY’S SHOW, HE

00:04:08.792 --> 00:04:12.228
BROUGHT UP RETIRED COPS AND

00:04:11.327 --> 00:04:12.562
RETIRED MILITARY BEING ON

00:04:12.362 --> 00:04:13.897
CAMPUS.

00:04:12.695 --> 00:04:15.365
I UNDERSTAND WHAT HE’S SAYING,

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:17.801
BUT I DISAGREE.

00:04:15.498 --> 00:04:18.935
I THINK YOU NEED TO MAKE SCHOOL

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:21.838
SECURITY A SPECIALTY.

00:04:19.069 --> 00:04:26.276
YOU NEED TO MAKE IT A SPECIALTY

00:04:21.972 --> 00:04:28.345
JUST LIKE TERRORISM.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.746
YOU NEED YOUNG OFFICERS THAT ARE

00:04:28.478 --> 00:04:31.682
MOTIVATED IN THE BEGINNING OF

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:33.817
THEIR CAREER THAT ARE SHARP AND

00:04:31.815 --> 00:04:36.420
REALLY DEDICATED TO THE LONG

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.554
RANGE IN BEING IN THAT TYPE OF

00:04:36.553 --> 00:04:39.356
PROFESSION IN SCHOOL SECURITY

00:04:37.688 --> 00:04:40.190
BECAUSE OUR YOUTH ARE SOME OF

00:04:39.489 --> 00:04:42.593
THE MOST IMPORTANT PEOPLE IN THE

00:04:40.324 --> 00:04:44.261
COUNTRY AND YET IT SEEMS THAT WE

00:04:42.726 --> 00:04:46.597
SECURE THEM THE LEAST.

00:04:44.394 --> 00:04:48.265
&gt;&gt;  RANDY, BACK TO YOU.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:50.033
GIVEN THE FACT THAT THEY KNEW HE

00:04:48.399 --> 00:04:51.802
WAS VERY TROUBLED -- AND THERE

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.169
ARE A LOT OF KIDS THAT ARE

00:04:51.935 --> 00:04:55.840
TROUBLED.

00:04:52.302 --> 00:04:58.342
A LOT OF KIDS THAT COME FROM

00:04:55.973 --> 00:05:00.911
BROKEN HOMES THAT SEEM TO HAVE

00:04:58.475 --> 00:05:04.582
ANGER, OSTRACIZED.

00:05:01.045 --> 00:05:07.084
HE HAD VERY FEW FRIENDS

00:05:04.715 --> 00:05:09.520
APPARENTLY AT THE SCHOOL.

00:05:07.218 --> 00:05:10.955
WE HAVEN’T FOUND ONE FRIEND OR

00:05:09.653 --> 00:05:13.224
ACQUAINTANCE OF HIM.

00:05:11.088 --> 00:05:15.726
SO, GIVEN THAT THEY KNEW ALL

00:05:13.357 --> 00:05:16.661
THIS ABOUT HIM -- I’M NOT SAYING

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.095
THEY SHOULD HAVE KNOWN HE WAS

00:05:16.794 --> 00:05:19.564
GOING TO SHOOT, BUT IS THERE ANY

00:05:18.229 --> 00:05:23.134
INTERVENTIONS THAT YOU CAN DO

00:05:19.697 --> 00:05:24.836
EITHER AT THE HOME WITH HIM THAT

00:05:23.267 --> 00:05:28.373
COULD HAVE PREVENTED THIS?

00:05:24.969 --> 00:05:29.774
HE WAS EXPELLED FROM THE SCHOOL

00:05:28.506 --> 00:05:32.276
FOR OBVIOUS REASON.

00:05:29.907 --> 00:05:35.480
&gt;&gt;  ONCE THE AUTOPSY OF THIS

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:37.615
INDIVIDUAL IS DONE, A

00:05:35.613 --> 00:05:38.883
PSYCHOLOGICAL AUTOPSY IS DONE,

00:05:37.749 --> 00:05:41.786
THEY’LL DISCOVER THERE WAS A

00:05:39.017 --> 00:05:43.688
NUMBER OF KEY FACTORS THAT SET

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:46.057
RED FLAGS UP ALL OVER THE PLACE.

00:05:43.822 --> 00:05:47.759
NOTHING HAPPENS IN A VACUUM.

00:05:46.191 --> 00:05:50.996
THERE ARE PEOPLE THAT ALREADY

00:05:47.892 --> 00:05:54.165
HAVE SPOKEN THAT KNEW THIS GUY

00:05:51.129 --> 00:05:56.902
HAD PREDILECTIONS FOR VIOLENCE

00:05:54.299 --> 00:05:57.769
AND HE WAS MAKING THESE

00:05:57.035 --> 00:05:59.437
COMMENTS.

00:05:57.903 --> 00:06:00.538
HE WAS SHOWING BASICALLY I THINK

00:05:59.571 --> 00:06:01.740
HIS CARDS IN ADVANCE.

00:06:00.672 --> 00:06:04.676
BUT I WANT TO TALK ABOUT

00:06:01.873 --> 00:06:05.043
SOMETHING THAT MARK JUST SPOKE

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:08.613
ABOUT.

00:06:05.177 --> 00:06:11.083
AND ISRAEL IN THE ’70S DEALT

00:06:08.747 --> 00:06:13.018
WITH THE SCHOOLS BEING TARGETED

00:06:11.216 --> 00:06:14.886
BY TERRORISTS.

00:06:13.151 --> 00:06:16.221
AND THEY LIVED THROUGH

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.623
UNFORTUNATELY THE MURDERS OF A

00:06:16.355 --> 00:06:18.457
NUMBER OF SCHOOL CHILDREN.

00:06:17.756 --> 00:06:23.462
AND THEY HAVE STOPPED IT.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:23.729
AND YOU KNOW WHAT, LAURA, WE CAN

00:06:23.595 --> 00:06:26.398
TOO.

00:06:23.862 --> 00:06:28.867
&gt;&gt;  MARK, FINALLY ON THIS, THE

00:06:26.532 --> 00:06:30.703
AR-15 LOOKS LIKE IT WAS HIS

00:06:30.836 --> 00:06:34.540
THAT WAS INVOLVED IN THE SAN

00:06:33.439 --> 00:06:36.175
BERNARDINO SHOOTING, SANDY HOOK,

00:06:34.673 --> 00:06:39.578
THE PULSE NIGHTCLUB.

00:06:36.308 --> 00:06:41.013
YOU ALREADY SEE THE PUSH ABOUT

00:06:39.712 --> 00:06:45.818
RE-EXAMINING THE AR-15.

00:06:41.147 --> 00:06:46.252
TELL US A LITTLE BIT ABOUT THAT

00:06:45.951 --> 00:06:47.987
WEAPON.

00:06:46.385 --> 00:06:48.988
ONE OF THE MOST POPULAR FIREARMS

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:51.123
IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:06:49.121 --> 00:06:54.026
BUT THAT CLEARLY IS BEING

00:06:51.257 --> 00:06:54.360
TARGETED BY THE ANTI-GUN FOLKS

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:57.463
TONIGHT.

00:06:54.493 --> 00:07:00.800
&gt;&gt;  WELL, IT’S CALLED THE M4

00:06:57.597 --> 00:07:01.100
PLATFORM AND IT’S BASED ON THE

00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:03.269
AR-15.

00:07:01.234 --> 00:07:05.371
AND YES, THERE’S A LOT OF THEM.

00:07:03.402 --> 00:07:05.705
AND MOST OF THEM ARE USED

00:07:05.505 --> 00:07:07.173
LEGALLY.

00:07:05.838 --> 00:07:09.709
IF A SUSPECT CHOOSES THAT WEAPON

00:07:07.306 --> 00:07:11.711
AND YOU TAKE THAT WEAPON AWAY,

00:07:09.842 --> 00:07:13.546
THEY’VE BEEN MAKING WEAPONS

00:07:11.844 --> 00:07:15.748
SINCE ABOUT 1908 THAT ARE

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:17.617
AUTOMATIC FIRED WEAPONS THAT CAN

00:07:15.882 --> 00:07:21.054
DELIVER JUST AS MUCH FIRE POWER

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.655
AND ALMOST AS FAST AS AN AR-15.

00:07:21.187 --> 00:07:24.657
IN THE HANDS OF A COMPETENT

00:07:22.789 --> 00:07:25.425
PERSON, YOU DON’T EVEN NEED

00:07:24.791 --> 00:07:27.227
THAT.

00:07:25.558 --> 00:07:28.428
YOU NEED SOMETHING THAT IS VERY

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.330
-- ALMOST AN ANTIQUE WEAPON TO

00:07:28.561 --> 00:07:33.900
DO THE SAME AMOUNT OF DAMAGE.

00:07:30.463 --> 00:07:35.368
SO IT’S IN THE HANDS OF A

00:07:34.034 --> 00:07:37.504
SKILLED PERSON.

00:07:35.502 --> 00:07:37.938
AN AR-15 MAKES UP FOR THAT A

00:07:37.637 --> 00:07:39.906
LITTLE BIT.

00:07:38.071 --> 00:07:40.373
BUT IT IS NOT THE REASON THAT

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.975
THIS OCCURRED.

00:07:40.507 --> 00:07:45.779
THE REASON THAT THIS OCCURRED IS

00:07:42.108 --> 00:07:47.581
NOT ONLY A MENTAL ILLNESS, IT’S

00:07:45.912 --> 00:07:49.449
SECURITY, IT’S NOT HAVING A

00:07:47.714 --> 00:07:51.585
HARDENED TARGET, AND ACTUALLY

00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:53.186
NOT ANYBODY PAYING ATTENTION TO

00:07:51.718 --> 00:07:56.590
ALL THE FLAGS.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:58.926
&gt;&gt;  WELL, THANK YOU, GENTLEMEN,

